very rare, characterized by prenatal lymphedema with increased nuchal translucency, pronounced muscular hypotonia in infancy, borderline intelligence, postnatal short stature due to growth hormone deficiency, and a variety of minor anomalies such as mildly bell-shaped chest, minor congenital heart defects and a distinct facial gestalt. Larger deletions including bands 5q35.1, 5q35.2 and 5q35.3 cause a more severe phenotype that associates severe developmental delay with microcephaly, and significant cardiac defects (e.g. atrial septal defect with/without atrioventricular conduction defects, Ebstein anomaly, tetralogy of Fallot) linked to haploinsufficiency of <i>NKX2.5</i> (5q35.1). Various combinations of signs may result from deletions of variable extent depending on the genes comprised in the deleted segment.", "additionalProperty": [{"@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "CNV cause", "value": "deletion"}, {"@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Orphanet prevalence class", "value": "<1 / 1 000 000"}], "signOrSymptom": [{"@type": "MedicalSignOrSymptom", "name": "Abnormal heart morphology", "code": {"@type": "MedicalCode", "codeValue": "HP:0001627", "codingSystem": "HPO"}, "sameAs": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001627", "additionalProperty": {"@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Orphanet frequency", "value": "Very frequent (99-80%)"}}, {"@type": "MedicalSignOrSymptom", "name": "Large fontanelles", "code": {"@type": "MedicalCode", "codeValue": "HP:0000239", "codingSystem": "HPO"}, "sameAs": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000239", "additionalProperty": {"@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Orphanet frequency", "value": "Frequent (79-30%)"}}, {"@type": "MedicalSignOrSymptom", "name": "Macrocephaly", "code": {"@type": "MedicalCode", "codeValue": "HP:0000256", "codingSystem": "HPO"}, "sameAs": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000256", "additionalProperty": {"@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Orphanet frequency", "value": "Frequent (79-30%)"}}, {"@type": "MedicalSignO